cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  The primary content of this repository is the research notes and derivations
  under analysis/ and supplement/ (see preferred-citation below); the Python
  source under src/ checks them and draws figures. If you use or build on this
  work, please cite it as below. Oziewicz's own papers are not part of this work
  and are cited separately; see references/bibliography.md.
title: "oziewicz: notes and derivations on the mathematical physics of Zbigniew Oziewicz"
